      <p class="lede">Recorded talks exploring language, judgment, and how groups learn together.</p>
    </div>
  </header>
  <div class="content">
    <div style="background: rgba(201,168,76,0.1); padding: 2rem; border-radius: 8px; border-left: 4px solid #c9a84c; text-align: center; max-width: 600px; margin: 3rem auto;">
      <h2 style="font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Coming Soon</h2>
      <p>Recorded lectures will be added here soon. In the meantime, explore Elie's written work on these topics in the <a href="/writing/">Essays section</a> or reach out via <a href="mailto:elie@cohortlearninglabs.org">email</a>.</p>
